<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>HOJ Hostel | Safe, Clean & Comfortable Hostel in Ajah, Lagos</title>
  <meta name="description" content="HOJ Hostel provides safe, clean and comfortable accommodation in Ajah, Lagos for students, corpers, trainees and visitors." />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Clash+Display:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#0a0a0c;
      --bg-soft:#121216;
      --panel:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      --panel-2:rgba(255,255,255,0.09);
      --line:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      --text:#f5f5f7;
      --muted:#b1b1ba;
      --orange:#ff7a1a;
      --orange-2:#ff9f5a;
      --orange-soft:rgba(255,122,26,0.15);
      --shadow:0 25px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
      --radius:24px;
      --max:1180px;
      --transition:all .35s ease;
    }

    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
    body{
      margin:0;
      font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(255,122,26,.12), transparent 22%),
        radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(255,255,255,.05), transparent 18%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #080809 0%, #0d0d10 100%);
      color:var(--text);
      overflow-x:hidden;
    }

    body::before{
      content:"";
      position:fixed;
      inset:0;
      pointer-events:none;
      z-index:0;
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.025) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,.025) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size:34px 34px;
      mask-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,.15), rgba(0,0,0,0));
    }

    a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}
    img{max-width:100%;display:block}
    .container{width:min(92%, var(--max));margin:0 auto;position:relative;z-index:1}

    .topbar{
      position:sticky;
      top:0;
      z-index:999;
      backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
      background:rgba(8,8,10,.72);
      border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);
    }

    .nav{
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:space-between;
      min-height:78px;
      gap:20px;
    }

    .brand{
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      gap:14px;
    }

    .brand-mark{
      width:50px;
      height:50px;
      border-radius:16px;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, rgba(255,255,255,.15), transparent 40%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, #1c1c22, #0e0e12);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      display:grid;
      place-items:center;
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
      position:relative;
      overflow:hidden;
    }

    .brand-mark::after{
      content:"";
      position:absolute;
      inset:0;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,122,26,.16), transparent 65%);
    }

    .brand-mark span{
      font-family:'Clash Display',sans-serif;
      font-size:1.1rem;
      font-weight:700;
      color:var(--orange);
      position:relative;
      z-index:1;
    }

    .brand-text strong{
      display:block;
      font-size:1rem;
      letter-spacing:.01em;
    }

    .brand-text small{
      display:block;
      color:var(--muted);
      margin-top:3px;
      font-size:.76rem;
      letter-spacing:.12em;
      text-transform:uppercase;
    }

    .nav-links{
      display:flex;
      gap:28px;
      align-items:center;
    }

    .nav-links a{
      color:var(--muted);
      font-weight:500;
      font-size:.96rem;
      transition:var(--transition);
    }

    .nav-links a:hover{color:#fff}

    .nav-cta{
      padding:12px 18px;
      border-radius:999px;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--orange), var(--orange-2));
      color:#111;
      font-weight:800;
      box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(255,122,26,.28);
    }

    .menu-btn{
      display:none;
      width:48px;
      height:48px;
      border-radius:14px;
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);
      color:#fff;
      font-size:1.2rem;
      cursor:pointer;
    }

    .hero{
      padding:58px 0 44px;
      position:relative;
    }

    .hero-grid{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:1.12fr .88fr;
      gap:24px;
      align-items:stretch;
    }

    .glass{
      background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.07), rgba(255,255,255,.03));
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
      border-radius:var(--radius);
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    }

    .hero-copy{
      padding:48px;
      position:relative;
      overflow:hidden;
    }

    .badge{
      display:inline-flex;
      align-items:center;
      gap:10px;
      padding:10px 14px;
      border-radius:999px;
      background:var(--orange-soft);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,122,26,.22);
      color:#ffd2b0;
      font-size:.84rem;
      font-weight:700;
      margin-bottom:20px;
    }

    .hero h1{
      margin:0;
      font-family:'Clash Display',sans-serif;
      font-size:clamp(2.6rem, 6vw, 5rem);
      line-height:.95;
      letter-spacing:-.04em;
      max-width:11ch;
    }

    .hero h1 .accent{
      color:var(--orange);
    }

    .hero p{
      margin:20px 0 28px;
      color:var(--muted);
      line-height:1.8;
      font-size:1.02rem;
      max-width:620px;
    }

    .hero-actions{
      display:flex;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
      gap:14px;
      margin-bottom:28px;
    }

    .btn{
      display:inline-flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:center;
      gap:10px;
      padding:15px 22px;
      border-radius:999px;
      font-weight:800;
      transition:var(--transition);
      border:1px solid transparent;
    }

    .btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}
    .btn-primary{
      background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--orange), var(--orange-2));
      color:#101010;
      box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(255,122,26,.25);
    }
    .btn-secondary{
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);
      border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.1);
      color:#fff;
    }

    .trust-row{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
      gap:12px;
    }

    .trust-pill{
      padding:14px 15px;
      border-radius:18px;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      font-size:.9rem;
      color:#e9e9ec;
      text-align:center;
      font-weight:700;
    }

    .hero-visual{
      padding:18px;
      display:flex;
      flex-direction:column;
      gap:14px;
    }

    .main-visual{
      min-height:430px;
      border-radius:24px;
      overflow:hidden;
      position:relative;
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,.08), rgba(0,0,0,.58)),
        url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522708323590-d24dbb6b0267?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80') center/cover no-repeat;
    }

    .main-visual .overlay{
      position:absolute;
      inset:auto 18px 18px 18px;
      padding:20px;
      border-radius:22px;
      background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(20,20,24,.35), rgba(20,20,24,.82));
      backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
    }

    .overlay strong{
      font-size:1.1rem;
      display:block;
      margin-bottom:6px;
    }

    .overlay span{
      color:#ddd;
      font-size:.95rem;
      line-height:1.6;
    }

    .mini-cards{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
      gap:14px;
    }

    .mini-card{
      padding:18px;
      border-radius:20px;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
    }

    .mini-card strong{
      display:block;
      margin-bottom:6px;
    }

    .mini-card span{
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:.92rem;
      line-height:1.6;
    }

    section{
      padding:30px 0;
      position:relative;
      z-index:1;
    }

    .section-head{
      display:flex;
      justify-content:space-between;
      gap:18px;
      align-items:end;
      margin-bottom:22px;
    }

    .section-head h2{
      margin:0;
      font-family:'Clash Display',sans-serif;
      font-size:clamp(1.7rem, 4vw, 3rem);
      letter-spacing:-.03em;
    }

    .section-head p{
      margin:0;
      color:var(--muted);
      line-height:1.8;
      max-width:720px;
    }

    .features{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
      gap:18px;
    }

    .feature{
      padding:24px;
      transition:var(--transition);
    }

    .feature:hover{
      transform:translateY(-5px);
      border-color:rgba(255,122,26,.22);
    }

    .icon{
      width:54px;
      height:54px;
      border-radius:18px;
      display:grid;
      place-items:center;
      margin-bottom:16px;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,122,26,.18), rgba(255,255,255,.05));
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      font-size:1.25rem;
      color:var(--orange);
    }

    .feature h3{
      margin:0 0 10px;
      font-size:1.08rem;
    }

    .feature p{
      margin:0;
      color:var(--muted);
      line-height:1.75;
      font-size:.96rem;
    }

    .about-grid,
    .location-grid,
    .cta-grid{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
      gap:20px;
      align-items:stretch;
    }

    .about-box,
    .location-box,
    .map-box,
    .cta-box{
      padding:30px;
    }

    .about-box h3,
    .location-box h3,
    .map-box h3,
    .cta-box h3{
      margin:0 0 12px;
      font-size:1.35rem;
      font-family:'Clash Display',sans-serif;
      letter-spacing:-.02em;
    }

    .about-box p,
    .location-box p,
    .map-box p,
    .cta-box p{
      margin:0 0 18px;
      color:var(--muted);
      line-height:1.8;
    }

    .about-list{
      display:grid;
      gap:12px;
    }

    .about-list div{
      padding:14px 16px;
      border-radius:18px;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      color:#ececf0;
      font-weight:600;
    }

    .gallery{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;
      gap:18px;
    }

    .gallery-main,
    .gallery-stack .stack{
      border-radius:26px;
      overflow:hidden;
      position:relative;
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      min-height:260px;
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
      background-size:cover;
      background-position:center;
    }

    .gallery-main{
      min-height:500px;
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,.06), rgba(0,0,0,.52)),
        url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1505693416388-ac5ce068fe85?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80');
    }

    .gallery-stack{
      display:grid;
      gap:18px;
    }

    .stack.one{
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,.06), rgba(0,0,0,.52)),
        url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1505693416388-ac5ce068fe85?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80');
    }

    .stack.two{
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,.06), rgba(0,0,0,.52)),
        url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1484154218962-a197022b5858?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80');
    }

    .image-caption{
      position:absolute;
      left:18px;
      right:18px;
      bottom:18px;
      padding:16px 18px;
      border-radius:18px;
      background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(18,18,22,.34), rgba(18,18,22,.84));
      backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
    }

    .image-caption strong{
      display:block;
      margin-bottom:5px;
      font-size:1rem;
    }

    .image-caption span{
      color:#ddd;
      font-size:.92rem;
      line-height:1.6;
    }

    .stay-grid{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
      gap:18px;
    }

    .stay-card{
      padding:28px;
      position:relative;
      overflow:hidden;
      transition:var(--transition);
    }

    .stay-card:hover{
      transform:translateY(-5px);
      border-color:rgba(255,122,26,.2);
    }

    .stay-card::after{
      content:"";
      position:absolute;
      right:-36px;
      top:-36px;
      width:120px;
      height:120px;
      border-radius:50%;
      background:rgba(255,122,26,.08);
      filter:blur(4px);
    }

    .stay-card h3{
      margin:0 0 8px;
      font-size:1.25rem;
      font-family:'Clash Display',sans-serif;
    }

    .stay-card p{
      margin:0 0 18px;
      color:var(--muted);
      line-height:1.75;
    }

    .stay-card ul{
      list-style:none;
      padding:0;
      margin:0;
      display:grid;
      gap:10px;
    }

    .stay-card li{
      color:#efeff2;
      font-size:.95rem;
    }

    .contact-list{
      display:grid;
      gap:12px;
    }

    .contact-item{
      padding:15px 16px;
      border-radius:18px;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
    }

    .contact-item strong{
      display:block;
      margin-bottom:4px;
    }

    .contact-item span{
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:.95rem;
    }

    .map-box{
      min-height:100%;
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.05), rgba(255,255,255,.02)),
        radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(255,122,26,.12), transparent 28%);
    }

    .map-preview{
      margin-top:18px;
      border-radius:22px;
      min-height:250px;
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,.14), rgba(0,0,0,.4)),
        url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1514924013411-cbf25faa35bb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80') center/cover no-repeat;
      display:flex;
      align-items:flex-end;
      padding:18px;
    }

    .map-chip{
      padding:12px 14px;
      border-radius:999px;
      background:rgba(10,10,12,.75);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      color:#fff;
      font-weight:700;
      backdrop-filter:blur(8px);
    }

    .final-cta{
      padding:34px;
      background:
        linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,122,26,.16), rgba(255,255,255,.03)),
        rgba(255,255,255,.03);
    }

    .final-cta .cta-row{
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:space-between;
      gap:20px;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
    }

    footer{
      padding:14px 0 34px;
      color:var(--muted);
      position:relative;
      z-index:1;
    }

    .footer-box{
      padding-top:22px;
      border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      display:flex;
      justify-content:space-between;
      gap:16px;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
      font-size:.95rem;
    }

    .wa-float{
      position:fixed;
      right:18px;
      bottom:18px;
      z-index:999;
      width:62px;
      height:62px;
      border-radius:50%;
      display:grid;
      place-items:center;
      font-size:1.6rem;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg, #25d366, #18b453);
      color:#fff;
      box-shadow:0 15px 40px rgba(37,211,102,.35);
    }

    .reveal{
      opacity:0;
      transform:translateY(28px);
      transition:opacity .75s ease, transform .75s ease;
    }

    .reveal.show{
      opacity:1;
      transform:translateY(0);
    }

    @media (max-width: 1050px){
      .hero-grid,
      .about-grid,
      .location-grid,
      .gallery,
      .cta-grid{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
      }

      .features,
      .stay-grid{
        grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
      }

      .trust-row{
        grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 760px){
      .menu-btn{display:grid;place-items:center}
      .nav-links{
        position:absolute;
        left:4%;
        right:4%;
        top:76px;
        display:none;
        flex-direction:column;
        align-items:flex-start;
        gap:16px;
        padding:18px;
        border-radius:20px;
        background:rgba(10,10,12,.96);
        border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
        box-shadow:var(--shadow);
      }
      .nav-links.open{display:flex}
      .hero-copy{padding:28px}
      .hero-visual{padding:14px}
      .features,
      .stay-grid,
      .trust-row,
      .mini-cards{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
      }
      .section-head{
        flex-direction:column;
        align-items:flex-start;
      }
      .main-visual{min-height:350px}
      .gallery-main{min-height:320px}
      .gallery-stack .stack{min-height:220px}
      .final-cta{padding:24px}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header class="topbar">
    <div class="container nav">
      <a href="#home" class="brand">
        <div class="brand-mark"><span>HOJ</span></div>
        <div class="brand-text">
          <strong>HOJ Hostel</strong>
          <small>House of Jesse · Ajah, Lagos</small>
        </div>
      </a>

      <button class="menu-btn" id="menuBtn">☰</button>

      <nav class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#rooms">Rooms</a>
        <a href="#stay">Stay Options</a>
        <a href="#location">Location</a>
        <a href="https://wa.me/2347052444573" target="_blank" class="nav-cta">Book via WhatsApp</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="home">
      <div class="container hero-grid">
        <div class="glass hero-copy reveal">
          <div class="badge">Safe · Clean · Comfortable Accommodation</div>
          <h1>Safe, Clean & <span class="accent">Comfortable Hostel</span> in Ajah, Lagos.</h1>
          <p>
            HOJ Hostel provides a welcoming accommodation experience for students, corpers,
            trainees, and visitors. Designed for comfort, trust, and convenience, with flexible
            stay options from daily to monthly bookings.
          </p>

          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a href="https://wa.me/2347052444573" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary">Book via WhatsApp</a>
            <a href="#rooms" class="btn btn-secondary">View Rooms</a>
          </div>

          <div class="trust-row">
            <div class="trust-pill">CCTV Surveillance</div>
            <div class="trust-pill">Steady Electricity</div>
            <div class="trust-pill">Male & Female Hostel</div>
            <div class="trust-pill">Ajah, Lagos</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="glass hero-visual reveal">
          <div class="main-visual">
            <div class="overlay">
              <strong>Trust starts with presentation.</strong>
              <span>
                A cleaner, more professional online presence helps guests quickly understand
                the rooms, features, location, and booking process.
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mini-cards">
            <div class="mini-card">
              <strong>Flexible Booking</strong>
              <span>Stay for a day, a week, or for months depending on your needs.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="mini-card">
              <strong>Comfort & Security</strong>
              <span>Safe environment, clean spaces, and a setup built for peace of mind.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="features">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head reveal">
          <div>
            <h2>Why HOJ Hostel stands out</h2>
            <p>
              Accommodation decisions are driven by trust, clarity, and convenience.
              This concept highlights the features guests care about most at first glance.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="features">
          <div class="glass feature reveal">
            <div class="icon">🛡️</div>
            <h3>Safe Environment</h3>
            <p>Built to help guests feel secure and comfortable from arrival to checkout.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="glass feature reveal">
            <div class="icon">🎥</div>
            <h3>CCTV Surveillance</h3>
            <p>Security-focused presentation that reassures students, visitors, and working guests.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="glass feature reveal">
            <div class="icon">⚡</div>
            <h3>Steady Electricity</h3>
            <p>A practical value point that matters for comfort, productivity, and peace of mind.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="glass feature reveal">
            <div class="icon">🛏️</div>
            <h3>Clean Spacious Rooms</h3>
            <p>Well-presented room visuals help guests understand quality faster and trust the brand more.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="glass feature reveal">
            <div class="icon">📍</div>
            <h3>Ajah, Lagos</h3>
            <p>Clear location details make the hostel easier to find and more credible to first-time guests.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="glass feature reveal">
            <div class="icon">💬</div>
            <h3>Easy WhatsApp Booking</h3>
            <p>Direct communication creates a smoother path from interest to inquiry and booking.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="about">
      <div class="container about-grid">
        <div class="glass about-box reveal">
